Lirum Device Info is the most complete and elegant application to retrieve real time status of your device. You will be able to monitor its performance, compare its specifications with other models and watch feedback from your device's sensors (magnetometer, accelerometer, gyroscope, GPS). Check out real battey status, voltage and wear level.

Universal App for iPad/iPod Touch/iPhone

EXCLUSIVE FEATURES:
- Apple Watch Support - Displays phone diagnostics right on your watch! (Displays data from your iPhone on the Apple Watch, not the other way around)
- Hardware Browser - Shows hardware tree of components inside the iOS Device;
- Bluetooth LE Scanner - Shows Bluetooth LE devices in range and broadcasted data and signal strength;
- Comparison of iPads, iPhones and iPod Touch generations (Resolution, Dimensions, Features, etc);
- Real-time multicore optimized CPU Usage Monitor;
- Memory allocation graph with "Force Memory Release" option;
- Real-time graph of the Accelerometer/Magnetometer/Gyroscope/Barometer sensors;
- GPS Receiver status data;
- Hardware tests for Vibration/Flashlight features (on iPhones);
- Touchscreen/LCD Color and Contrast tests;

OTHER FEATURES:
- Dimensions shown in american (imperial) or metric units (configurable);
Hundreds of specifications, such as:

Display
- Size, Resolution, Pixels Count, Pixels Density, Aspect Ratio, Color Depth, Amount of Colours, Contrast Ratio;
- Display Type, GPU Model, Number of GPU Cores, Latest OpenGL Version supported by the GPU;
- Width, Height, Depth, Weight;
CPU Informations
- Real time multicore CPU graph;
- CPU Name;
- Number of Cores;
- CPU Core Base;
- CPU Clock, Maximum Clock, Current Clock (when variable);
- Manufacturing Process;
- CPU Pipeline Depth;
- Cache L1, L2;
- Instruction Set;
- CPU Issue Width;
- Out of Order Execution Feature;
- "Designed by" and "Manufactured by" Information;
System Data
- Real time Memory Allocation graph;
Connectivity
- Wireless IP;
- Cellular network IP;
- Support for Wifi 802.11b,g,n;
- Bluetooth Version;
- Bluetooth A2DP, PBAB Profile, PAN, HID, HFP, EDR, AVRCP;
- Frequencies for 2G and 3G GSM/CDMA Bands;
- LTE (4G) Bands and Frequencies;
- LTE Maximum Download/Upload Speed;
- SIM Card Format / Slot;
Camera
- Both Cameras Resolution in Megapixels or in Pixels Resolution (width x height);
- Both Cameras Pixels Count/Focal Ratio;
- Tap to Focus/Macro/White Balance/IR Filter/Geo Tagging Support;
- Face Detection/Flash/HDR Features;
- Video Recording Resolution/Frames per Second count/Video Light/Stabilisation;
Battery
- Estimated Duration for: Browsing on Wifi, Browsing on 3G, Talking in 3G (iPhone only), Audio and Video Playback, GPS Navigation, Book reading and Standby;
- Battery Type and Capacity in mAh;
- Amount of Energy in W.h and Joules;
- Battery Voltage (when fully charged);
Sensors
- GPS Receiver Data (Latitude and Longitude in both decimal and Degrees, Speed, Accuracy, Altitude, Last Time Updated);
- Real-time Accelerometer/Magnetometer/Gyroscope monitors;
- Presence of Gyroscope, Proximity Sensor, Ambient Light Sensor, Accelerometer, A-GPS Receiver, GLONASS Receiver and Digital Compass;
Other Informations
- Operating and Non operating Temperatures;
- Maximum operating Altitudes;
- Relative humidity;
- Specific Absorption Rate (FCC US and Council of the European Union);
Compare Devices
- Allows the user to compare and export all of the information above;

Check more details at
http://www.liruminfo.com
and
http://www.lirumlabs.com

AXIS ASSISTANT is an App conceived as a tool to: find a given angle, detect tilt and also to measure a sector size in degrees.

This tool can be useful in many applications such as:

• The steepness of a slope;
• Can be used for hanging pictures, diplomas or photographs on a wall;
• Useful for photography to detect the horizon;
• It measures the angle of an arc (for example in architecture);
• And much more, your imagination is the limit.

Se você gosta da sua agenda organizada e padronizada com o +55 (código internacional do Brasil), este é o app.

O Brasil +55 analisa sua agenda, mostra uma prévia de como devem ficar os números e atualiza todos os seus contatos com o +55.

Exemplos:
De: 5555-5555
Para: +55 (11) 5555-5555

De: 94444-4444
Para: +55 (11) 94444-4444

De: (021) 2333-3333
Para: +55 (21) 2333-3333

De: (031 16) 4222-2222
Para: +55 (16) 4222-2222

CARACTERÍSTICAS:
- Insere o +55 em todos os números;
- Remove o +55 de todos os números;
- Pré-visualização dos números a serem atualizados;
- Reconhece números com 9 Dígitos e altera corretamente;
- Reconhece e trata corretamente números no formato 4004-xxxx e 3003-xxxx;
- Ignora números com # ou * (Rádio);

Se você possui um carro flex, você tem a opção de escolher o combustível mais barato na hora de abastecer.

O álcool ou etanol rende, em média, 70% da mesma quantidade de gasolina. Você pode fazer um cálculo proporcional e descobrir qual dos combustíveis terá o melhor custo/benefício.

Porém, este nem sempre é um calculo trivial, e nem sempre é viável de se fazer enquanto o frentista lhe aguarda.

Por isso, criamos o app "Álcool ou Gasolina?"!

- Você chega para abastecer no posto, abre o app e digita o valor do litro do álcool e da gasolina anunciados;
- O app rapidamente já lhe informa qual o melhor combustível naquele posto, e quanto você irá economizar.

Ao contrário dos outros apps de calculadora de combustível, o "Álcool ou Gasolina" foi projetado para ser o mais prático possível:

- Todo o processo é feito com apenas 6 toques na tela;
- Tudo é feito na mesma tela;
- O app salva os último valores digitados;
- Sem anúncios, não requer internet, é rápido e leve;
- Com apenas uma abastecida, você já pode recuperar o pequeno investimento feito no app!

O "Álcool ou Gasolina" é um app desenvolvido no Brasil, caso goste da experiência não deixe de nos avaliar. =)

Ever needed to start a chat on WhatsApp with a number you don't intend adding to your contacts? Enters Launcher for WhatsApp.

- Send chat messages to phone numbers you don't have in your Contacts;
- The most lightweight WhatsApp launcher in the App Store;
- Zero ads, for the best user experience possible;
- As-you-type phone number formatting;
- Infers the country code based on your phone's locale, so you don't have to type it.
- Built with privacy in mind: this app collects absolutely no data from you, the numbers entered, nor your phone. Not even for analytics purposes.

We will never display any ads in this app, ever. We will never offer in-app purchases either.

An Apple Watch (standalone, no phone required), iPhone and iPad app for using Alexa.

Control your home devices, ask general questions, add and remove items to your shopping list and set timers etc.  It is an Alexa implementation.  On your wrist.

There are ten things you should know before getting this app:

1. The Series 3 watch and newer are supported; The best experience is with the Apple Watch 4 and newer;  
3. Your phone controls installation of the app to the watch, not the app.  Put your watch on a charger to speed up install time;
4. Not all audio content can be supported.  Amazon don't allow third-party apps such as this app to play music, audio books or some daily-news content, make announcements or drop-in;
5. You can use a Siri Shortcut to launch the app and start speaking, just by raising your wrist on Apple Watch.  See the support page on how to configure;
6. All watch complication types are supported, including those really weird ones.  Also you can change the complication icon under Settings;
7. The watch app can listen automatically on launch. There is an option under settings to do the same thing on the iPhone;
8. If the weather or time are wrong, ensure you've enabled Location access in the Alexa app to the "Voice in a Can" device, and that you have granted Location permissions to the app on your phone;
9. You don't have to say "Alexa" ... just speak your command when the app is listening;
10. You can change the language that you speak and hear responses in, under "Settings" on the watch and phone.  Only languages supported by Alexa are supported. The language should be set automatically.

If you have questions or any support issues please don't hesitate to email damian@voiceinacan.com ... you should get a response within 24 hours, and often in minutes.

